---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Stuck Between Pixels" description="Privacy Policy for the Stuck Between Pixels website.">
  <article class="prose dark:prose-invert mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-16 md:px-8">
    <h1 class="display-tight text-4xl font-medium">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="kicker text-fg-muted">Effective August 27, 2026</p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-fg-muted">
      MrDemonWolf, Inc. ("we," "our," or "us") operates stuckbetweenpixels.com, the
      website for the Stuck Between Pixels podcast. This Privacy Policy explains what
      information this website collects and why.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      This is a static site: there are no accounts, no sign-in, no comment forms, and
      no newsletter signup. We don't collect names, emails, or any personal
      information directly through this site. What we do use:
    </p>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-fg-muted">
      <li>
        <strong>Google Analytics</strong> — measures page views and general audience
        size so we know which episodes and topics resonate. It sets a cookie in your
        browser and sends Google an anonymized-where-possible record of the pages you
        visit here. It does not run until you've loaded the page — see Section 2 for
        how to opt out.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>A theme preference</strong> — your light/dark choice is saved in your
        browser's local storage, not a cookie, never leaves your device, and isn't
        tied to you in any way.
      </li>
      <li>We do not use advertising or ad networks, and we do not sell any data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">2. Google Analytics</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      Google Analytics is provided by Google LLC. It uses cookies and similar
      technologies to analyze how visitors use this site. Google's own privacy
      practices govern the data it collects on its end:
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-ember hover:underline">
        Google Privacy Policy
      </a>. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking across all sites using the
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-ember hover:underline">
        Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on
      </a>, or by using a browser/extension that blocks analytics scripts.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">3. Hosting</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      This site is hosted on <strong>GitHub Pages</strong> (GitHub, Inc.). GitHub may
      log standard technical information (such as IP address and request timestamps)
      as part of operating its infrastructure. This logging is governed by
      GitHub's own privacy statement:
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" class="text-ember hover:underline">
        GitHub Privacy Statement
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">4. Links to other services</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      This site links out to where the podcast is actually distributed and hosted,
      including <strong>Spotify for Creators</strong> and <strong>Apple Podcasts</strong>,
      embeds the Spotify player on episode pages, and links to the hosts' own sites
      (mrdemonwolf.com, moerman.dev) and social profiles. Once you leave
      stuckbetweenpixels.com or interact with an embedded player, that service's own
      privacy policy applies — we don't control and aren't responsible for their data
      practices.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">5. Children's privacy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      This site does not knowingly collect information from anyone, including
      children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">6. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      If what this site collects ever changes, we'll update this page and its
      effective date to reflect that honestly.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 display-tight text-2xl font-medium">7. Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-fg-muted">
      Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:contact@stuckbetweenpixels.com" class="text-ember hover:underline">contact@stuckbetweenpixels.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
